==Rules==
{{StageRule|13thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 18.67~23.33 seconds<sup>560f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

